  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-08T05:53:16.435Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am hoping to confront this issue in good faith, that I also may believe could eventually save the life of any struggling VRChat users who are dealing with problems related to alcoholism.\n\nSome users could have mental or physical conflicts associated with consuming alcohol while in social VR. It may be a good idea to remove this prompt for the benefit of users who are abstaining, or are in remission.\nVRChat is also a platform for users 13+, and it may be an unpopular idea for users of any age to easily access an adult-oriented world by a suggested prompt.",
